== status codes
200 404
== framing
nothing: incomplete
content-length: complete
content-length, content missing: incomplete
head section not finished: incomplete
two responses: complete
extra bytes: incomplete
304 without content: complete
100 alone: incomplete
100 then 204: complete
101: unframed
no reason phrase: complete
HTTP/1.0: complete, close
HTTP/1.0 with keep-alive: complete
transfer-encoding gzip alone: unframed
connection: close: complete, close
close, then a response that does not close: complete
huge content-length: incomplete
content-length too large for an int: unframed
content-length +2: unframed
content-length 0x2: unframed
huge chunk size: incomplete
chunk size 1_0: unframed
chunked: complete
chunked, last chunk missing: incomplete
chunked, bad size: unframed
chunked wins over content-length: complete
delimited by the close: unframed
not a response: unframed
